---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Comparing SpareTank Free vs SpareTank Pro • SpareTank Blog">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/blog" class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-emerald hover:underline mb-8 inline-block">
      ← Back to News &amp; Releases
    </a>

    <header class="mb-10 space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-mono text-muted">
        <span>September 15, 2026</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span class="text-brand-emerald font-semibold">Product Comparison</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Comparing SpareTank Free vs SpareTank Pro
      </h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-main/90 leading-relaxed text-base">
      <p>
        At Tekromancy, our philosophy is to build powerful hardware-oriented tools that respect user autonomy. When preparing SpareTank for Google Play, we structured two clean editions.
      </p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto my-8">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-sm border border-border-subtle rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
          <thead class="bg-surface text-main font-bold">
            <tr>
              <th class="p-4 border-b border-border-subtle">Feature</th>
              <th class="p-4 border-b border-border-subtle">SpareTank (Free)</th>
              <th class="p-4 border-b border-border-subtle text-brand-emerald">SpareTank Pro</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="text-muted divide-y divide-border-subtle">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-semibold text-main">Battery Longevity Monitoring</td>
              <td class="p-4">Yes</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-brand-emerald font-bold">Yes</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-semibold text-main">Customizable Charging Limits</td>
              <td class="p-4">Yes (Full Range)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-brand-emerald font-bold">Yes (Full Range)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-semibold text-main">Emergency Spare Tank Shutdown</td>
              <td class="p-4">Yes</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-brand-emerald font-bold">Yes</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-semibold text-main">AdMob Advertising SDK</td>
              <td class="p-4">Included (Banner)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-brand-emerald font-bold">Completely Excluded (0 bytes)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-semibold text-main">Package Name</td>
              <td class="p-4 font-mono text-xs">com.tekromancy.sparetank</td>
              <td class="p-4 font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan">com.tekromancy.sparetankpro</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-semibold text-main">Google Play Model</td>
              <td class="p-4">Free Download</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-brand-emerald font-bold">Paid Upfront (No Subs)</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-emerald pt-4">Which should you pick?</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">
        If you prefer a free utility with unobtrusive banner ads, choose <strong>SpareTank</strong>. If you want a 100% ad-free experience with zero third-party SDK dependencies and want to directly support independent development, choose <strong>SpareTank Pro</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
